  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Business elite mapping</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to explore opportunities and challenges related to the engagement of the Netherlands in Private Sector Development and specifically the agriculture sector, in Mali. A complete analysis of the main opportunities and challenges offered by this sector is crucial for the Dutch engagement to achieve its desired goals. This project seeks to provide such analysis, including concrete recommendations on how to maximize the benefits of Dutch engagement, while at the same time mitigating risks.&#xa0; This project will provide insight in the people and organisations that dominate the economy of Mali. More specifically it will identify the main influencers in the agriculture sector, and their relation to politics.The research will provide the private sector development (PSD) teams at the Embassy, DDE and the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO) with information that is relevant for future decision making.</narrative>
  </description>
